    <briefdescription>
<para>LRU cache of resolved locations, keyed by entity id. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>On overflow past <computeroutput>max_size</computeroutput> the least-recently-used entry is evicted. A <computeroutput>get</computeroutput> or re-<computeroutput>insert</computeroutput> promotes an entry to most-recently-used. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
